  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, combine the mixed greens and chopped dates.",
    "2. Crumbling the feta cheese, add it to the bowl and toss gently.",
    "3. Add the salad olives to the bowl and stir to combine.",
    "4. In a small bowl, whisk together the olive oil and red wine vinegar.",
    "5. Drizzle the dressing over the salad and toss to coat.",
    "6. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "7. Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "8. Serve chilled and enjoy!"
